# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw pixel data for the eMMC asset store (tools/assets_out/*.BIN)
#
# These are bare RGB565 / RGBA arrays with no file header. git decides between
# text and binary by looking for a NUL byte near the start of a file, and the
# map tiles have none there, so without this line they are taken for text. On
# Windows, where core.autocrlf defaults to true, every 0x0A byte would then
# become 0x0D 0x0A on checkout and the tiles would no longer be the size the
# firmware checks for.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.BIN binary
*.bin binary
